@startuml Appendix C Direct Streaming Flowchart

!theme plain
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam padding 5
skinparam nodesep 80
skinparam ranksep 80

title Appendix C - Direct Streaming Alternative Architecture

' Define layers
package "Presentation Layer" {
    component [sim-engine-frontend] as frontend #LightYellow
    note right of frontend
      - Submit simulation requests
      - Poll job status
    end note
}

package "API Layer" {
    component [sim-engine-backend] as backend #23c6b7
    note right of backend
      - REST API endpoints
      - Event publishing
      - Status aggregation
    end note
}

package "Message Infrastructure" {
    queue "Message Broker" as broker #LightBlue {
        queue "simulation.requested" as reqTopic
        queue "calculation.completed" as calcTopic
        queue "persistence.completed" as persistTopic
    }
}

package "Processing Layer" {
    component [calculation-engine] as calcEngine #LightGreen
    note right of calcEngine
      - Query source data
      - Stream results directly
      - No intermediate storage
    end note

    component [simulation-engine] as simEngine #23c6b7
    note right of simEngine
      - Receive streaming data
      - Bulk insert to DB
      - Publish completion
    end note
}

package "Data Layer" {
    database "Source Database" as sourceDB #LightGray

    database "Simulation DB" as simDB #LightGray
}

' Connections with labels
frontend -down-> backend: [1] HTTPS REST\nPOST /simulation

backend -down-> reqTopic: [2] Publish\nsimulation.requested

reqTopic -down-> calcEngine: [3] Consume

calcEngine -down-> sourceDB: [4] SQL Query\n(Native protocol)
sourceDB -up-> calcEngine: [5] Stream\nresult set

calcEngine -right-> simEngine: [6] gRPC streaming\nor Arrow Flight\n(Direct stream)

note on link
  **Direct Streaming**
  No object storage
  needed
end note

simEngine -down-> simDB: [7] Bulk load\n(streaming)

calcEngine -down-> calcTopic: [8] Publish\ncalculation.completed

simEngine -down-> persistTopic: [9] Publish\npersistence.completed

persistTopic -up-> backend: [10] Consume

backend -up-> frontend: [11] Job status

' Flow annotations
legend right
  **Data Flow Sequence:**
  1-2: User interaction & async dispatch
  3-5: Source data query & streaming
  6: **Direct stream** (gRPC/Arrow Flight)
  7: Streaming bulk load to database
  8-9: Completion event publishing
  10-11: Status notification

  **Key Differences from Appendix A:**
  • No object storage intermediate layer
  • Direct streaming between engines
  • Lower latency, reduced storage costs
  • Tighter coupling between services

  **Technology Options:**
  • gRPC streaming (bidirectional)
  • Apache Arrow Flight (columnar)
  • Custom streaming protocol
end legend

@enduml

